o ensure stability of rates, statistics were not reported if the numerator had fewer than 16 observations.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"the incidence and mortality rate ratios among black women to those among white women were calculated\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}